And sometimes let go of what we'd like to recognize that's not what's going on here.

149
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:10,360
And we may need to regroup.

150
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,100
Mistakes will happen.

151
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:15,780
Social mistakes happen all the time, put your foot in your mouth.

